{"title": "Defensive Protocol: Bulwark", "pageid": 23119, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp, /w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Defensive Protocol: Bulwark</b> is a free action used by the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Titan\" title=\"Steel Watcher Titan\">Steel Watcher Titan</a> in response to taking significant damage. The Titan enters a stationary, defensive state where it can unleash a devastating barrage of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\">Hellfire Missiles</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nHunker down into an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unyielding_Construct_(Condition)\" title=\"Unyielding Construct (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unyielding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unyielding_Construct_(Condition)\" title=\"Unyielding Construct (Condition)\">Unyielding</a> state and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repair_Matrix_(Condition)\" title=\"Repair Matrix (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repair\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repair_Matrix_(Condition)\" title=\"Repair Matrix (Condition)\">Repair</a> yourself. While hunkered, you can launch <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\">Hellfire Missiles</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Protocol\" title=\"Repelling Protocol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Protocol\" title=\"Repelling Protocol\">Repel</a> combatants.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Twice per battle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Twice per battle</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_SteelWatcher_Quadruped_ActivateBulwarkMode</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_SteelWatcher_Quadruped_ActivateBulwarkMode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_SteelWatcher_Quadruped_ActivateBulwarkMode\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> First use unlocked when below 75% HP</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_SteelWatcher_Quadruped_ActivateBulwarkMode2</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_SteelWatcher_Quadruped_ActivateBulwarkMode2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_SteelWatcher_Quadruped_ActivateBulwarkMode2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Second use unlocked when below 50% HP</div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsEnemySpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsEnemySpell (spell flag)\">IsEnemySpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\">Hellfire Missiles</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Protocol\" title=\"Repelling Protocol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repelling Protocol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Protocol\" title=\"Repelling Protocol\">Repelling Protocol</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark\"> Condition: Defensive Protocol: Bulwark </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark (Condition)\">Defensive Protocol: Bulwark</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>While in this defensive state, the Steel Watcher becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unyielding_Construct_(Condition)\" title=\"Unyielding Construct (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unyielding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unyielding_Construct_(Condition)\" title=\"Unyielding Construct (Condition)\">Unyielding</a> and can use its <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repair_Matrix_(Condition)\" title=\"Repair Matrix (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repair Matrix\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repair_Matrix_(Condition)\" title=\"Repair Matrix (Condition)\">Repair Matrix</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\">Hellfire Missiles</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Protocol\" title=\"Repelling Protocol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repelling Protocol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Protocol\" title=\"Repelling Protocol\">Repelling Protocol</a>.</li>\n<li>Also grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"75 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 75 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>.</li>\n<li>If the Steel Watcher loses these temporary hit points, he automatically uses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Terminate_Bulwark_Protocol\" title=\"Terminate Bulwark Protocol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Terminate Bulwark Protocol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Terminate_Bulwark_Protocol\" title=\"Terminate Bulwark Protocol\">Terminate Bulwark Protocol</a> and loses this condition.</li>\n<li>If hit by a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flashblinder\" title=\"Flashblinder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/GRN_Flashblinder_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-GRN_Flashblinder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/GRN_Flashblinder_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-GRN_Flashblinder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/GRN_Flashblinder_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-GRN_Flashblinder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/GRN_Flashblinder_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-GRN_Flashblinder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/GRN_Flashblinder_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flashblinder\" title=\"Flashblinder\">Flashblinder</a>, the Steel Watcher loses this condition.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Unyielding_Construct\"> Condition: Unyielding Construct </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unyielding_Construct_(Condition)\" title=\"Unyielding Construct (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unyielding Construct\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unyielding_Construct_(Condition)\" title=\"Unyielding Construct (Condition)\">Unyielding Construct</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Only an attack dealing at least 15 damage can harm this Steel Watcher.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Repair_Matrix\"> Condition: Repair Matrix </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repair_Matrix_(Condition)\" title=\"Repair Matrix (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repair Matrix\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repair_Matrix_(Condition)\" title=\"Repair Matrix (Condition)\">Repair Matrix</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>At the start of its turn, restorative servos heal this Steel Watcher for <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">3d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Titan\" title=\"Steel Watcher Titan\">Steel Watcher Titan</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In total, while in this state, the Steel Watcher Titan has the following effects:\n<ul><li>Gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"75 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 75 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>, increased to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"200 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 200 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Honour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour\">Honour</a> mode.</li>\n<li>Heals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">3d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> per round, increased to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">6d8+14</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> on Honour mode.</li>\n<li>Ignores any damage less than 15 points, with the threshold increased to 40 on Honour mode. Note that this does not reduce the damage of an attack that exceeds the threshold.</li>\n<li>Becomes immobile.</li>\n<li>Gains access to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\">Hellfire Missiles</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Protocol\" title=\"Repelling Protocol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Protocol\" title=\"Repelling Protocol\">Repel</a>.</li>\n<li>Loses access to all its other actions such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Steel_Watcher_Titan)\" title=\"Multiattack (Steel Watcher Titan)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/20px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/30px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/40px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/20px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Steel_Watcher_Titan)\" title=\"Multiattack (Steel Watcher Titan)\">Multiattack</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Launch_Protocol:_Bola\" title=\"Launch Protocol: Bola\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Launch Protocol: Bola\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Launch_Protocol:_Bola\" title=\"Launch Protocol: Bola\">Launch Protocol: Bola</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Curse\" title=\"Hellfire Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Curse\" title=\"Hellfire Curse\">Hellfire Curse</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>This action technically has a once per combat limit but the Steel Watcher Titan is given two identical copies of it. As a result, it can can use this action twice per combat.</li>\n<li>The Steel Watcher Titan unlocks this action after dropping to certain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a> thresholds. Once it is below 75% HP, it can use the first copy of the ability. It unlocks the second use after dropping to 50% HP.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715055211\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.133 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.139 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6992/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 103438/4194304 bytes\n